---
manual: check.click
lines: [2988, 2993]
testability: interactive
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $states = []
  @box = check
  @box.click { $states << @box.checked? }
end
----------- test code
assert_empty $states

check.trigger_click
assert_equal [true], $states, "the click block runs when the box is checked"

check.trigger_click
assert_equal [true, false], $states, "and again when it is unchecked"
